<title>USA: U.S. bulk millfeeds - Business remains slow.</title>
<headline>U.S. bulk millfeeds - Business remains slow.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. spot millfeed prices were mostly steady Friday in an abbreviated Thanksgiving holiday week, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;It is quiet,&quot; one dealer said. &quot;Most people are not in.&quot;</p>
<p>Some flour mills were due to take downtimes, starting Wednesday and feed mills took Thursday, Thanksgiving, off, dealers said.</p>
<p>During holiday weeks, logistical problems arise due to the mill downtimes, dealers said.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
